--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DESIGN PROVENANCE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The agent preset in presets/ is written against the public contracts of the
DeepSeek Harness plugin system (@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-preset,
@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-subagent, @deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client,
@deepseek-ai/dsh-skill-filesystem and others).

It was informed by studying the behaviour of a third-party preset
(@linxin666/dsh-liangshen, "梁神"). No code from that package is included here.
The preset's comments record where a design decision was made in response to
observed behaviour — including the cases where that preset's approach was
deliberately NOT followed — because a stated reason is reviewable and an
unstated one is not.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
MEASURED CLAIMS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Numbers in README.md and in the composition's comments come from measurements
taken on a specific machine (Windows, 586 stored sessions, ~1,044 recorded tool
failures). They describe what was observed there. They are not benchmarks and
should not be read as general performance figures.

Where a claim could not be verified it is marked as withdrawn rather than
deleted, so the correction stays visible. See the notes on `workflow-ptc` and on
`presentation: native` in presets/kunlun/agent.cordis.yml.
